 little and I peeped inside. When we walked in, everyone","w":0.43902439117431635,"x":0.50332593464196251,"h":0.011865793780687417,"y":0.78477905084216282},{"y":0.79651162801871755,"x":0.50332594216149285,"w":0.011086474657058698,"text":"1","h":0.010174418042022126},{"h":0.010319529110398129,"text":"at me for what seemed like forever. I could feel all","y":0.79941860500515172,"w":0.31263856887817376,"x":0.62971175247887334},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"text":"thirty teenagers looking at me. I kept my eyes on the floor. 'Sit here,","y":0.81249999996047084,"x":0.50332593464196251,"w":0.43902439117431635},{"h":0.013150382549204753,"text":"Max, the teacher said. Quickly 12","x":0.50332595204608732,"y":0.82405891953112942,"w":0.23281595230102548},{"text":"_up and then","x":0.84700665562456223,"y":0.82692307695024303,"w":0.095343675613403289,"h":0.010286225039518038},{"x":0.50110864423583634,"text":"looked down again as I walked to the desk. When the other students","w":0.441241683959961,"h":0.011865793780687417,"y":0.84001636642477395},{"y":0.8531096562556566,"h":0.011865793780687417,"w":0.17294898986816398,"x":0.50332595068676045,"text":"had gone back to work, 13"},{"x":0.78713969400347505,"w":0.15521063804626467,"text":"_ at the board, but l was","y":0.85465116301750632,"h":0.010324286946298167},{"y":0.8677325583422536,"h":0.011627906668205679,"w":0.441241683959961,"x":0.50110864068816463,"text":"feeling so stressed that | just couldn't concentrate - and I definitely"},{"x":0.5031883200123114,"y":0.8807241856271868,"text":"wasn't going to explain that to the teacher. I 4","w":0.29747962951660156,"h":0.014026228222636328},{"text":"out","w":0.026607537269592307,"y":0.88226744173326554,"x":0.91574279470592812,"h":0.0087209301962594132},{"x":0.50554322940469487,"y":0.89525368245127213,"w":0.4345898056030274,"text":"of the window when I suddenly saw some hockey players outside","h":0.011865793780687417},{"x":0.50110864821060586,"y":0.90834697211131399,"h":0.013164655666694669